                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="DiscoveryDataDescription.InstanceVariable"/>
                  <body>A cdi:InstanceVariable as referenced by schema:variableMeasured. At Data Description level, every InstanceVariable must have an @id and a cdif:physicalDataType so physical mappings can reference it.</body>
               </ownedComment>
               <name>InstanceVariable</name>
